cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Promptotyping working practice, its templates or its skill, please cite it as below."
title: "Promptotyping"
version: "1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  Promptotyping is a working practice for translating research data and their
  contexts into research artefacts that fit the researchers' questions and ways
  of working, through Knowledge Engineering, Context Engineering and Agentic
  Engineering. This repository holds the practice specification, the templates
  for the project knowledge base, documented use cases, a tutorial, an
  introduction page and the Promptotyping skill for AI coding agents.
